  <body dur="03:45.900">
    <div begin="00:21.480" end="03:45.900">
      <p begin="00:21.480" end="00:25.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:21.480" end="00:22.110">Ra</span><span begin="00:22.110" end="00:22.200">ge</span> <span begin="00:22.510" end="00:22.780">from</span> <span begin="00:22.780" end="00:22.900">the</span> <span begin="00:22.980" end="00:23.240">moun</span><span begin="00:23.330" end="00:23.780">tain</span> <span begin="00:23.780" end="00:23.960">bli</span><span begin="00:23.960" end="00:24.190">s</span><span begin="00:24.190" end="00:24.980">ter</span><span begin="00:24.980" end="00:25.110">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">山巅迸发的怒火灼烧一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">山巔迸發的怒火灼燒一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">山より噴き出す怒りが焼きただれる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">산에서 뿜어진 분노가 살을 태워</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La rage de la montagne brûle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La furia de la montaña abrasa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Der Zorn des Berges schlägt glühende Wunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A fúria da montanha queima e deixa feridas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ярость гор обжигает всё вокруг</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La furia della montagna ustiona</span></p>
      <p begin="00:25.820" end="00:28.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:25.820" end="00:26.050">Like</span> <span begin="00:26.050" end="00:26.110">the</span> <span begin="00:26.110" end="00:26.260">s</span><span begin="00:26.260" end="00:26.910">tone</span> <span begin="00:26.910" end="00:27.030">be</span><span begin="00:27.110" end="00:27.330">nea</span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:27.490">th</span> <span begin="00:27.490" end="00:27.790">my</span> <span begin="00:27.890" end="00:28.330">fee</span><span begin="00:28.330" end="00:28.360">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同我脚下滚烫的岩石</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">如同我腳下滾燙的岩石</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">足元の岩石のように</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 발밑의 돌처럼 뜨겁게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Comme la pierre sous mes pieds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Como la roca bajo mis pies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wie der Stein unter meinen Füßen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Como a pedra sob os meus pés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Как раскалённый камень под моими ногами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Come la pietra sotto i miei piedi</span></p>
      <p begin="00:29.130" end="00:31.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:29.130" end="00:29.360">Where</span> <span begin="00:29.360" end="00:29.430">the</span> <span begin="00:29.560" end="00:29.970">de</span><span begin="00:29.970" end="00:30.280">mon</span><span begin="00:30.280" end="00:30.360">s</span> <span begin="00:30.360" end="00:30.580">fe</span><span begin="00:30.580" end="00:30.820">s</span><span begin="00:30.820" end="00:31.250">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">恶魔在那里滋生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">惡魔在那裡滋生</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">悪魔どもが蔓延る場所で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">악마들이 곪아 자라나는 곳에서</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Là où les démons suppurent</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Donde los demonios se pudren</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo die Dämonen schwären</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Onde os demônios apodrecem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Там где гноятся демоны</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Là dove i demoni marciscono</span></p>
      <p begin="00:31.250" end="00:33.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:31.250" end="00:31.330">And</span> <span begin="00:31.420" end="00:31.780">pray</span> <span begin="00:31.880" end="00:32.100">for</span> <span begin="00:32.100" end="00:32.500">our</span> <span begin="00:32.500" end="00:32.590">de</span><span begin="00:32.690" end="00:33.260">fea</span><span begin="00:33.260" end="00:33.320">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈求着我们的败亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">祈求著我們的敗亡</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らは我らの敗北を祈っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 패배를 기도하지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et prient pour notre défaite</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y rezan por nuestra derrota</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und für unsere Niederlage beten</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E rezam pela nossa derrota</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И молятся о нашем поражении</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E pregano per la nostra disfatta</span></p>
      <p begin="00:33.720" end="00:38.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:33.720" end="00:33.910">I</span> <span begin="00:34.070" end="00:34.410">see</span> <span begin="00:34.410" end="00:34.570">s</span><span begin="00:34.570" end="00:35.560">mo</span><span begin="00:35.560" end="00:35.610">ke</span> <span begin="00:35.770" end="00:35.990">on</span> <span begin="00:35.990" end="00:36.120">the</span> <span begin="00:36.200" end="00:36.380">hot</span> <span begin="00:36.620" end="00:37.070">wind</span> <span begin="00:37.170" end="00:37.450">shim</span><span begin="00:37.450" end="00:38.040">mer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我看见浓烟在灼热的风中摇曳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我看見濃煙在灼熱的風中搖曳</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">熱風の中で揺らめく煙が見える</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">뜨거운 바람 속에서 아른거리는 연기가 보여</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vois la fumée trembler dans le vent brûlant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Veo el humo temblar en el viento ardiente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich sehe Rauch im heißen Wind flimmern</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vejo a fumaça tremeluzir no vento ardente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я вижу как дым дрожит в раскалённом ветру</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vedo il fumo tremolare nel vento ardente</span></p>
      <p begin="00:38.410" end="00:42.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:38.410" end="00:38.830">Soul</span><span begin="00:38.830" end="00:38.890">s</span> <span begin="00:38.890" end="00:39.270">un</span><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.340">re</span><span begin="00:39.340" end="00:39.480">s</span><span begin="00:39.480" end="00:39.910">train</span><span begin="00:39.910" end="00:39.950">ed,</span> <span begin="00:39.950" end="00:40.230">in</span> <span begin="00:40.330" end="00:40.540">de</span><span begin="00:40.540" end="00:40.760">s</span><span begin="00:40.760" end="00:40.980">perate</span> <span begin="00:41.170" end="00:41.970">nee</span><span begin="00:41.970" end="00:42.010">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">失控的灵魂 已无比渴求</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">失控的靈魂 已無比渴求</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">解き放たれた魂は必死に求めている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">속박에서 풀려난 영혼들은 간절히 원하고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Des âmes déchaînées qui ont désespérément besoin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Almas sin cadenas que necesitan desesperadamente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Entfesselte Seelen in verzweifelter Not</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Almas sem freios em necessidade desesperada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Неукрощённым душам отчаянно нужен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Anime senza catene disperatamente bisognose</span></p>
      <p begin="00:42.370" end="00:44.460" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:42.370" end="00:42.580">Of</span> <span begin="00:42.580" end="00:42.670">a</span> <span begin="00:42.770" end="00:43.220">fi</span><span begin="00:43.220" end="00:43.610">nal</span> <span begin="00:43.610" end="00:43.860">hell</span><span begin="00:44.000" end="00:44.460">fire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那最后一场地狱烈火</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那最後一場地獄烈火</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">最後の業火を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">마지막 지옥불을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">D’un ultime feu infernal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Un último fuego infernal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nach einem letzten Höllenfeuer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">De um último fogo infernal</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Последний адский огонь</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Di un ultimo fuoco infernale</span></p>
      <p begin="00:44.460" end="00:47.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:44.460" end="00:44.540">To</span> <span begin="00:44.670" end="00:45.090">burn</span> <span begin="00:45.090" end="00:45.160">the</span> <span begin="00:45.290" end="00:45.600">pa</span><span begin="00:45.600" end="00:45.720">st</span> <span begin="00:45.720" end="00:45.950">and</span> <span begin="00:46.070" end="00:46.360">set</span> <span begin="00:46.510" end="00:46.850">them</span> <span begin="00:46.950" end="00:47.960">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将过往焚尽 还他们以自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將過往焚盡 還他們以自由</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">過去を焼き払い 自由になるために</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">과거를 불태워 자신들을 해방시킬 불꽃을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Pour brûler le passé et les libérer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que queme el pasado y las libere</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das die Vergangenheit verbrennt und sie befreit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Para queimar o passado e libertá-las</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Чтобы сжечь прошлое и освободить их</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che bruci il passato e le renda libere</span></p>
      <p begin="00:48.370" end="00:51.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:48.370" end="00:48.600">Through</span> <span begin="00:48.600" end="00:48.680">the</span> <span begin="00:48.810" end="00:49.230">fear,</span> <span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.440">through</span> <span begin="00:49.440" end="00:49.630">the</span> <span begin="00:49.630" end="00:50.080">heart</span> <span begin="00:50.080" end="00:50.360">that</span><span begin="00:50.360" end="00:50.470">'s</span> <span begin="00:50.470" end="00:50.690">bro</span><span begin="00:50.690" end="00:51.270">ken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过恐惧 穿过那颗破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過恐懼 穿過那顆破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐怖を越え 傷つき砕けた心を越え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려움을 지나 부서진 마음을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la peur à travers ce cœur brisé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través del miedo a través del corazón quebrado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch die Angst durch das gebrochene Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através do medo através do coração despedaçado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь страх сквозь разбитое сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso la paura attraverso il cuore spezzato</span></p>
      <p begin="00:51.720" end="00:54.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:51.720" end="00:52.180">Our</span> <span begin="00:52.180" end="00:52.550">world</span> <span begin="00:52.970" end="00:53.360">lie</span><span begin="00:53.360" end="00:53.420">s</span> <span begin="00:53.420" end="00:53.620">in</span> <span begin="00:53.620" end="00:53.850">wait</span> <span begin="00:53.950" end="00:54.120">for</span> <span begin="00:54.200" end="00:54.600">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的世界正等待着我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的世界正等待著我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この世界は私を待ち構えている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 세계가 나를 기다리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Notre monde m’attend dans l’ombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nuestro mundo me aguarda al acecho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unsere Welt liegt da und wartet auf mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nosso mundo está à minha espera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наш мир затаился в ожидании меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il nostro mondo resta in attesa di me</span></p>
      <p begin="00:54.960" end="00:57.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:54.960" end="00:55.160">E</span><span begin="00:55.160" end="00:55.230">ve</span><span begin="00:55.230" end="00:55.320">ry</span> <span begin="00:55.410" end="00:55.870">tear,</span> <span begin="00:55.870" end="00:56.020">e</span><span begin="00:56.020" end="00:56.070">ve</span><span begin="00:56.070" end="00:56.150">ry</span> <span begin="00:56.150" end="00:56.290">s</span><span begin="00:56.290" end="00:56.720">car</span> <span begin="00:56.720" end="00:56.990">le</span><span begin="00:56.990" end="00:57.060">f</span><span begin="00:57.060" end="00:57.130">t</span> <span begin="00:57.130" end="00:57.270">o</span><span begin="00:57.320" end="00:57.950">pen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一滴泪 每一道尚未愈合的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一滴淚 每一道尚未癒合的傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべての涙 すべての開いたままの傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 눈물 아물지 않은 모든 흉터</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque larme chaque cicatrice encore béante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz aún abierta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jede Träne jede offen gebliebene Narbe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz ainda aberta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждая слеза каждый незаживший шрам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni lacrima ogni cicatrice rimasta aperta</span></p>
      <p begin="00:58.320" end="01:01.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:58.320" end="00:58.650">Thi</span><span begin="00:58.650" end="00:58.800">s</span> <span begin="00:58.800" end="00:59.100">i</span><span begin="00:59.100" end="00:59.190">s</span> <span begin="00:59.380" end="00:59.520">the</span> <span begin="00:59.520" end="01:00.010">ta</span><span begin="01:00.010" end="01:00.210">ming</span> <span begin="01:00.210" end="01:00.420">of</span> <span begin="01:00.420" end="01:00.480">the</span> <span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.990">bea</span><span begin="01:00.990" end="01:01.110">st</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是驯服野兽之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是馴服野獸之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今こそ獣を屈服させる時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 짐승을 길들이는 방식이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est ainsi qu’on dompte la bête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así se doma a la bestia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist die Zähmung der Bestie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É assim que se doma a fera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это укрощение зверя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è domare la bestia</span></p>
      <p begin="01:01.410" end="01:04.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:01.410" end="01:01.870">I'll</span> <span begin="01:01.870" end="01:02.270">end</span> <span begin="01:02.270" end="01:02.480">thi</span><span begin="01:02.480" end="01:02.680">s</span> <span begin="01:02.680" end="01:03.110">war</span> <span begin="01:03.110" end="01:03.350">you</span> <span begin="01:03.350" end="01:03.520">s</span><span begin="01:03.520" end="01:03.910">tar</span><span begin="01:03.910" end="01:04.370">ted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会终结由你挑起的战争</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會終結由你挑起的戰爭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前が始めたこの戦争を私が終わらせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 시작한 이 전쟁을 내가 끝내겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je mettrai fin à cette guerre que tu as déclenchée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pondré fin a esta guerra que tú empezaste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diesen Krieg beenden den du begonnen hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou pôr fim à guerra que você começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я положу конец войне которую ты начал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Metterò fine alla guerra che hai iniziato</span></p>
      <p begin="01:04.710" end="01:07.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:04.710" end="01:05.010">I'll</span> <span begin="01:05.010" end="01:05.160">s</span><span begin="01:05.160" end="01:05.400">ti</span><span begin="01:05.400" end="01:05.570">tch</span> <span begin="01:05.570" end="01:05.720">thi</span><span begin="01:05.800" end="01:05.980">s</span> <span begin="01:05.980" end="01:06.330">woun</span><span begin="01:06.330" end="01:06.380">d</span> <span begin="01:06.380" end="01:06.620">wi</span><span begin="01:06.620" end="01:06.730">th</span> <span begin="01:06.730" end="01:07.070">blood</span><span begin="01:07.170" end="01:07.780">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会以鲜血将这道伤口缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會以鮮血將這道傷口縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流血でこの傷を縫い合わせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 상처를 피로 꿰매겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je recoudrai cette blessure avec le sang versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Suturaré esta herida con sangre derramada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diese Wunde mit Blutvergießen vernähen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou suturar esta ferida com sangue derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я зашью эту рану кровопролитием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricucirò questa ferita con altro sangue</span></p>
      <p begin="01:08.220" end="01:16.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:08.220" end="01:08.700">You</span> <span begin="01:08.700" end="01:09.080">are</span> <span begin="01:09.340" end="01:09.580">my</span> <span begin="01:09.580" end="01:09.750">wi</span><span begin="01:09.830" end="01:10.040">cked</span> <span begin="01:10.150" end="01:10.510">vic</span><span begin="01:10.510" end="01:10.770">to</span><span begin="01:10.770" end="01:16.070">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我染罪的胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你就是我染罪的勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前こそ私の邪悪なる勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 나의 사악한 승리야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es ma victoire impie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres mi victoria maldita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist mein unheilvoller Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a minha vitória profana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты моя порочная победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la mia vittoria maledetta</span></p>
      <p begin="01:29.050" end="01:34.760" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:29.050" end="01:29.180">D</span><span begin="01:29.180" end="01:29.620">raw</span> <span begin="01:29.620" end="01:29.970">me</span> <span begin="01:29.970" end="01:30.230">to</span> <span begin="01:30.230" end="01:30.420">the</span> <span begin="01:30.420" end="01:31.640">ligh</span><span begin="01:31.640" end="01:31.690">t,</span> <span begin="01:32.020" end="01:32.150">let</span> <span begin="01:32.260" end="01:32.340">the</span> <span begin="01:32.430" end="01:32.660">cur</span><span begin="01:32.660" end="01:32.800">se</span> <span begin="01:32.890" end="01:33.290">be</span> <span begin="01:33.290" end="01:33.460">li</span><span begin="01:33.460" end="01:33.570">f</span><span begin="01:33.720" end="01:34.720">te</span><span begin="01:34.720" end="01:34.760">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">引我走向光明 让这诅咒就此解除</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">引我走向光明 讓這詛咒就此解除</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を光へ導け 呪いを解き放て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 빛으로 이끌어 저주를 걷어 내</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Attire-moi vers la lumière que la malédiction soit levée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Atráeme hacia la luz deja que la maldición se disipe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Zieh mich ins Licht lass den Fluch von mir weichen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Leve-me até a luz deixe a maldição se desfazer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Веди меня к свету пусть проклятие спадёт</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Guidami verso la luce lascia che la maledizione sia spezzata</span></p>
      <p begin="01:35.390" end="01:37.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:35.390" end="01:35.570">We</span> <span begin="01:35.570" end="01:35.810">can</span> <span begin="01:35.810" end="01:36.360">ri</span><span begin="01:36.360" end="01:36.420">se</span> <span begin="01:36.420" end="01:36.510">a</span><span begin="01:36.640" end="01:36.910">bo</span><span begin="01:36.910" end="01:37.020">ve</span> <span begin="01:37.020" end="01:37.260">the</span> <span begin="01:37.260" end="01:37.930">roar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们能够凌驾于这咆哮之上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們能夠凌駕於這咆哮之上</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この咆哮さえ乗り越えてゆける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 그 포효마저 뛰어넘을 수 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous pouvons nous élever au-dessus du fracas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Podemos alzarnos por encima del rugido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir können uns über das Tosen erheben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Podemos nos erguer acima do rugido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы поднимемся над этим рёвом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Possiamo elevarci sopra il fragore</span></p>
      <p begin="01:38.900" end="01:40.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:38.900" end="01:38.990">With</span> <span begin="01:39.110" end="01:39.180">the</span> <span begin="01:39.320" end="01:39.520">bi</span><span begin="01:39.520" end="01:39.580">te</span> <span begin="01:39.580" end="01:39.740">of</span> <span begin="01:39.740" end="01:39.900">e</span><span begin="01:39.900" end="01:39.940">ve</span><span begin="01:39.940" end="01:40.020">ry</span> <span begin="01:40.140" end="01:40.350">de</span><span begin="01:40.350" end="01:40.520">vil</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凭借每一个恶魔留下的獠牙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">憑藉每一個惡魔留下的獠牙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これまで屠ってきた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 쓰러뜨려 온 모든 악마의</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec la morsure de tous les démons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con la mordida de cada demonio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit dem Biss jedes Teufels</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com a mordida de cada demônio</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">С каждым укусом каждого дьявола</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Con il morso di ogni diavolo</span></p>
      <p begin="01:40.560" end="01:43.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:40.560" end="01:40.850">We</span><span begin="01:40.850" end="01:40.920">'ve</span> <span begin="01:40.920" end="01:41.480">felled</span> <span begin="01:41.590" end="01:42.140">be</span><span begin="01:42.140" end="01:43.090">fore</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些曾被我们斩倒的恶魔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那些曾被我們斬倒的惡魔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべての悪魔の牙をもって</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">날카로운 이빨을 품고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que nous avons déjà abattus</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que ya hemos abatido</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den wir zuvor zu Fall gebracht haben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que já abatemos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Которого мы уже повергли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che abbiamo già abbattuto</span></p>
      <p begin="01:43.140" end="01:44.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:43.140" end="01:43.630">Drown</span> <span begin="01:43.630" end="01:43.980">them</span> <span begin="01:44.060" end="01:44.890">ou</span><span begin="01:44.890" end="01:44.940">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将他们的声音彻底淹没</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">將他們的聲音徹底淹沒</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らの声を掻き消せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 묻어 버려</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Fais-les taire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Siléncialos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Übertönt sie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Abafe todos eles</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Заглуши их</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Soffoca le loro voci</span></p>
      <p begin="01:45.480" end="01:47.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:45.480" end="01:45.610">Let</span> <span begin="01:45.720" end="01:45.780">the</span> <span begin="01:45.890" end="01:46.170">fog</span> <span begin="01:46.170" end="01:46.290">gi</span><span begin="01:46.290" end="01:46.380">ve</span> <span begin="01:46.380" end="01:46.560">way</span> <span begin="01:46.560" end="01:46.670">to</span> <span begin="01:46.670" end="01:47.000">cla</span><span begin="01:47.000" end="01:47.170">ri</span><span begin="01:47.170" end="01:47.480">ty</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让迷雾散尽 一切重归清明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">讓迷霧散盡 一切重歸清明</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">霧を晴らし 明晰なる視界を取り戻せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">안개가 걷히고 선명함이 드러나게 해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que le brouillard cède enfin à la clarté</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Deja que la niebla ceda ante la claridad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Lass den Nebel der Klarheit weichen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que a névoa dê lugar à clareza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пусть туман рассеется уступая ясности</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Lascia che la nebbia ceda alla chiarezza</span></p>
      <p begin="01:47.970" end="01:51.110" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:47.970" end="01:48.200">There</span> <span begin="01:48.200" end="01:48.280">i</span><span begin="01:48.280" end="01:48.380">s</span> <span begin="01:48.380" end="01:48.630">po</span><span begin="01:48.630" end="01:48.840">wer</span> <span begin="01:48.840" end="01:49.020">in</span> <span begin="01:49.020" end="01:49.090">the</span> <span begin="01:49.090" end="01:49.230">s</span><span begin="01:49.230" end="01:49.490">train</span> <span begin="01:49.490" end="01:49.660">of</span> <span begin="01:49.660" end="01:49.820">e</span><span begin="01:49.820" end="01:49.880">ve</span><span begin="01:49.880" end="01:50.010">ry</span> <span begin="01:50.010" end="01:50.380">dro</span><span begin="01:50.380" end="01:50.420">p</span> <span begin="01:50.420" end="01:50.590">I</span> <span begin="01:50.690" end="01:51.070">blee</span><span begin="01:51.070" end="01:51.110">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我流下的每一滴血 都凝聚着力量</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我流下的每一滴血 都凝聚著力量</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流す血の一滴一滴 その苦痛の中に力が宿る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 흘리는 피 한 방울 한 방울의 고통 속엔 힘이 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque goutte de sang que je verse porte en elle une force</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Hay poder en cada gota de sangre que derramo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In jedem Tropfen den ich blute liegt Kraft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Há poder no esforço de cada gota que sangro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В каждой капле моей крови есть сила страдания</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">C'è potere nello sforzo di ogni goccia che verso</span></p>
      <p begin="01:51.310" end="01:56.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:51.310" end="01:51.740">I</span> <span begin="01:51.740" end="01:52.070">a</span><span begin="01:52.070" end="01:52.130">m</span> <span begin="01:52.320" end="01:52.390">the</span> <span begin="01:52.520" end="01:52.790">ve</span><span begin="01:52.790" end="01:53.150">no</span><span begin="01:53.150" end="01:53.200">m</span> <span begin="01:53.200" end="01:53.560">and</span> <span begin="01:53.560" end="01:53.720">the</span> <span begin="01:53.720" end="01:56.270">cure</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是剧毒 亦是解药</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我是劇毒 亦是解藥</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私は毒であり その解毒でもある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나는 독이자 해독제</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je suis le venin et le remède</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Soy el veneno y la cura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich bin das Gift und das Heilmittel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu sou o veneno e a cura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я яд и я же лекарство</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sono il veleno e la cura</span></p>
      <p begin="01:56.600" end="01:57.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:56.600" end="01:56.960">Ta</span><span begin="01:56.960" end="01:57.080">ke</span> <span begin="01:57.080" end="01:57.880">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带我走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">帶我走吧</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を連れていけ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 데려가</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Emporte-moi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Llévame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Nimm mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Leve-me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забери меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Prendimi</span></p>
      <p begin="01:57.880" end="02:00.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:57.880" end="01:58.120">Through</span> <span begin="01:58.120" end="01:58.200">the</span> <span begin="01:58.300" end="01:58.740">fear,</span> <span begin="01:58.740" end="01:58.950">through</span> <span begin="01:58.950" end="01:59.160">the</span> <span begin="01:59.160" end="01:59.590">heart</span> <span begin="01:59.590" end="01:59.880">that</span><span begin="01:59.880" end="01:59.990">'s</span> <span begin="01:59.990" end="02:00.210">bro</span><span begin="02:00.210" end="02:00.790">ken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过恐惧 穿过那颗破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過恐懼 穿過那顆破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐怖を越え 傷つき砕けた心を越え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려움을 지나 부서진 마음을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la peur à travers ce cœur brisé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través del miedo a través del corazón quebrado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch die Angst durch das gebrochene Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através do medo através do coração despedaçado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь страх сквозь разбитое сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso la paura attraverso il cuore spezzato</span></p>
      <p begin="02:01.230" end="02:04.140" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:01.230" end="02:01.680">Our</span> <span begin="02:01.680" end="02:02.060">world</span> <span begin="02:02.470" end="02:02.860">lie</span><span begin="02:02.860" end="02:02.940">s</span> <span begin="02:02.940" end="02:03.070">in</span> <span begin="02:03.150" end="02:03.380">wait</span> <span begin="02:03.460" end="02:03.630">for</span> <span begin="02:03.720" end="02:04.140">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的世界正等待着我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的世界正等待著我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この世界は私を待ち構えている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 세계가 나를 기다리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Notre monde m’attend dans l’ombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Nuestro mundo me aguarda al acecho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unsere Welt liegt da und wartet auf mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Nosso mundo está à minha espera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Наш мир затаился в ожидании меня</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Il nostro mondo resta in attesa di me</span></p>
      <p begin="02:04.480" end="02:07.470" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:04.480" end="02:04.680">E</span><span begin="02:04.680" end="02:04.740">ve</span><span begin="02:04.740" end="02:04.840">ry</span> <span begin="02:04.920" end="02:05.390">tear,</span> <span begin="02:05.390" end="02:05.550">e</span><span begin="02:05.550" end="02:05.600">ve</span><span begin="02:05.600" end="02:05.660">ry</span> <span begin="02:05.660" end="02:05.810">s</span><span begin="02:05.810" end="02:06.250">car</span> <span begin="02:06.250" end="02:06.510">le</span><span begin="02:06.510" end="02:06.580">f</span><span begin="02:06.580" end="02:06.630">t</span> <span begin="02:06.630" end="02:06.780">o</span><span begin="02:06.850" end="02:07.470">pen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一滴泪 每一道尚未愈合的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一滴淚 每一道尚未癒合的傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべての涙 すべての開いたままの傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 눈물 아물지 않은 모든 흉터</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque larme chaque cicatrice encore béante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz aún abierta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jede Träne jede offen gebliebene Narbe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz ainda aberta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждая слеза каждый незаживший шрам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni lacrima ogni cicatrice rimasta aperta</span></p>
      <p begin="02:07.830" end="02:10.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:07.830" end="02:08.160">Thi</span><span begin="02:08.160" end="02:08.300">s</span> <span begin="02:08.300" end="02:08.630">i</span><span begin="02:08.630" end="02:08.710">s</span> <span begin="02:08.890" end="02:08.950">the</span> <span begin="02:09.050" end="02:09.520">ta</span><span begin="02:09.520" end="02:09.730">ming</span> <span begin="02:09.730" end="02:09.940">of</span> <span begin="02:09.940" end="02:10.020">the</span> <span begin="02:10.140" end="02:10.510">bea</span><span begin="02:10.510" end="02:10.630">st</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是驯服野兽之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是馴服野獸之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今こそ獣を屈服させる時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 짐승을 길들이는 방식이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est ainsi qu’on dompte la bête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así se doma a la bestia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist die Zähmung der Bestie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É assim que se doma a fera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это укрощение зверя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è domare la bestia</span></p>
      <p begin="02:10.930" end="02:13.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:10.930" end="02:11.390">I'll</span> <span begin="02:11.390" end="02:11.810">end</span> <span begin="02:11.810" end="02:11.980">thi</span><span begin="02:11.980" end="02:12.200">s</span> <span begin="02:12.200" end="02:12.660">war</span> <span begin="02:12.660" end="02:12.870">you</span> <span begin="02:12.870" end="02:13.040">s</span><span begin="02:13.040" end="02:13.440">tar</span><span begin="02:13.440" end="02:13.890">te</span><span begin="02:13.890" end="02:13.930">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会终结由你挑起的战争</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會終結由你挑起的戰爭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前が始めたこの戦争を私が終わらせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 시작한 이 전쟁을 내가 끝내겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je mettrai fin à cette guerre que tu as déclenchée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pondré fin a esta guerra que tú empezaste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diesen Krieg beenden den du begonnen hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou pôr fim à guerra que você começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я положу конец войне которую ты начал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Metterò fine alla guerra che hai iniziato</span></p>
      <p begin="02:14.240" end="02:17.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:14.240" end="02:14.510">I'll</span> <span begin="02:14.510" end="02:14.690">s</span><span begin="02:14.690" end="02:14.940">ti</span><span begin="02:14.940" end="02:15.100">tch</span> <span begin="02:15.100" end="02:15.270">thi</span><span begin="02:15.270" end="02:15.500">s</span> <span begin="02:15.500" end="02:15.870">woun</span><span begin="02:15.870" end="02:15.940">d</span> <span begin="02:15.940" end="02:16.180">wi</span><span begin="02:16.180" end="02:16.260">th</span> <span begin="02:16.260" end="02:16.600">blood</span><span begin="02:16.690" end="02:17.280">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会以鲜血将这道伤口缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會以鮮血將這道傷口縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流血でこの傷を縫い合わせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 상처를 피로 꿰매겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je recoudrai cette blessure avec le sang versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Suturaré esta herida con sangre derramada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diese Wunde mit Blutvergießen vernähen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou suturar esta ferida com sangue derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я зашью эту рану кровопролитием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricucirò questa ferita con altro sangue</span></p>
      <p begin="02:17.750" end="02:24.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:17.750" end="02:18.220">You</span> <span begin="02:18.220" end="02:18.600">are</span> <span begin="02:18.820" end="02:19.100">my</span> <span begin="02:19.100" end="02:19.250">wi</span><span begin="02:19.340" end="02:19.540">cked</span> <span begin="02:19.650" end="02:19.870">vic</span><span begin="02:20.020" end="02:20.270">to</span><span begin="02:20.270" end="02:21.470">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我染罪的胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你就是我染罪的勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前こそ私の邪悪なる勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 나의 사악한 승리야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es ma victoire impie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres mi victoria maldita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist mein unheilvoller Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a minha vitória profana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты моя порочная победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la mia vittoria maledetta</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:22.920" end="02:24.090"><span begin="02:22.920" end="02:23.220">(Vic</span><span begin="02:23.300" end="02:23.550">to</span><span begin="02:23.550" end="02:24.090">ry)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">승리</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Victoire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Victoria</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vitória</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vittoria</span></s