      <p begin="03:00.020" end="03:02.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="03:00.020" end="03:00.230">Made</span> <span begin="03:00.360" end="03:00.820">pure</span> <span begin="03:00.820" end="03:01.050">be</span><span begin="03:01.050" end="03:01.380">nea</span><span begin="03:01.380" end="03:01.440">th</span> <span begin="03:01.440" end="03:01.560">the</span> <span begin="03:01.660" end="03:02.200">kni</span><span begin="03:02.200" end="03:02.290">fe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在刀锋之下洗净</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">在刀鋒之下洗淨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">刃の下で清められる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">칼날 아래 정화되어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Purifiés sous la lame</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Purificados bajo el filo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unter der Klinge rein gemacht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Purificados sob a lâmina</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Очищены под лезвием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Purificati sotto la lama</span></p>
      <p begin="03:03.720" end="03:05.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:03.720" end="03:04.280">Clean</span><span begin="03:04.280" end="03:04.360">se</span> <span begin="03:04.360" end="03:04.700">and</span> <span begin="03:04.900" end="03:05.230">su</span><span begin="03:05.440" end="03:05.930">ture</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洗净并缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">洗淨並縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">浄め 縫い合わせろ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">씻어 내고 꿰매어라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Purifier et suturer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Purifica y sutura</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Reinige und vernähe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Purifique e suture</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Очисти и зашей</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Purifica e ricuci</span></p>
      <p begin="03:06.590" end="03:09.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="03:06.590" end="03:06.890">The</span> <span begin="03:06.890" end="03:07.040">g</span><span begin="03:07.040" end="03:07.600">reat</span> <span begin="03:07.600" end="03:08.240">di</span><span begin="03:08.240" end="03:09.320">vide</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那道巨大的裂隙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">那道巨大的裂隙</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この巨大な裂け目を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">거대한 균열을</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La grande fracture</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">La gran brecha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den großen Riss</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">A grande divisão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Великий разлом</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">La grande frattura</span></p>
      <p begin="03:09.940" end="03:12.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="03:09.940" end="03:10.110">We</span> <span begin="03:10.280" end="03:10.980">seal</span> <span begin="03:10.980" end="03:11.400">our</span> <span begin="03:11.490" end="03:11.760">fu</span><span begin="03:11.870" end="03:12.330">ture</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们将自己的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們將自己的未來</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私たちは未来を封じ込める</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 미래를 봉인하리라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Nous scellons notre avenir</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Sellamos nuestro futuro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir besiegeln unsere Zukunft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Selamos o nosso futuro</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Мы запечатаем наше будущее</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Sigilliamo il nostro futuro</span></p>
      <p begin="03:12.850" end="03:16.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:12.850" end="03:13.020">In</span> <span begin="03:13.020" end="03:13.070">a</span> <span begin="03:13.170" end="03:13.940">bla</span><span begin="03:13.940" end="03:14.080">ze</span> <span begin="03:14.680" end="03:14.810">o</span><span begin="03:14.810" end="03:14.910">f</span> <span begin="03:14.910" end="03:16.030">white</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">封存在炽白烈焰之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">封存在熾白烈焰之中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">白き灼光の中に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">백열의 불길 속에</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Dans un brasier d’un blanc aveuglant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">En una llamarada blanca</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In weißer Glut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Num clarão branco</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В ослепительно-белом пламени</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">In un incendio di bianco accecante</span></p>
      <p begin="03:17.350" end="03:26.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:17.350" end="03:17.570">Through</span> <span begin="03:17.570" end="03:17.650">the</span> <span begin="03:17.790" end="03:18.180">fear,</span> <span begin="03:18.180" end="03:18.410">through</span> <span begin="03:18.410" end="03:18.510">the</span> <span begin="03:18.620" end="03:18.960">heart</span> <span begin="03:19.050" end="03:19.350">that</span><span begin="03:19.350" end="03:19.460">'s</span> <span begin="03:19.460" end="03:19.870">bro</span><span begin="03:19.870" end="03:23.150">ken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过恐惧 穿过那颗破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">穿過恐懼 穿過那顆破碎的心</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">恐怖を越え 傷つき砕けた心を越え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">두려움을 지나 부서진 마음을 지나</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">À travers la peur à travers ce cœur brisé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">A través del miedo a través del corazón quebrado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Durch die Angst durch das gebrochene Herz</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Através do medo através do coração despedaçado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Сквозь страх сквозь разбитое сердце</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Attraverso la paura attraverso il cuore spezzato</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:21.930" end="03:26.270"><span begin="03:21.930" end="03:22.260">(Lie</span><span begin="03:22.260" end="03:22.360">s</span> <span begin="03:22.360" end="03:22.580">in</span> <span begin="03:22.580" end="03:22.910">way</span> <span begin="03:22.910" end="03:23.180">for</span> <span begin="03:23.180" end="03:26.270">me)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">正等待着我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">正等待著我</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">私を待ち構えている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">나를 기다리고 있어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">M’attend dans l’ombre</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me aguarda al acecho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Liegt da und wartet auf mich</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Está à minha espera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ждёт меня на пути</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Resta sul mio cammino</span></span></p>
      <p begin="03:23.950" end="03:26.920" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="03:23.950" end="03:24.150">E</span><span begin="03:24.150" end="03:24.190">ve</span><span begin="03:24.190" end="03:24.290">ry</span> <span begin="03:24.370" end="03:24.840">tear,</span> <span begin="03:24.840" end="03:24.990">e</span><span begin="03:24.990" end="03:25.030">ve</span><span begin="03:25.030" end="03:25.120">ry</span> <span begin="03:25.120" end="03:25.260">s</span><span begin="03:25.260" end="03:25.680">car</span> <span begin="03:25.680" end="03:25.960">le</span><span begin="03:25.960" end="03:26.030">f</span><span begin="03:26.030" end="03:26.090">t</span> <span begin="03:26.090" end="03:26.230">o</span><span begin="03:26.310" end="03:26.920">pen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一滴泪 每一道尚未愈合的伤痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">每一滴淚 每一道尚未癒合的傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">すべての涙 すべての開いたままの傷痕</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">모든 눈물 아물지 않은 모든 흉터</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Chaque larme chaque cicatrice encore béante</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz aún abierta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Jede Träne jede offen gebliebene Narbe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Cada lágrima cada cicatriz ainda aberta</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Каждая слеза каждый незаживший шрам</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ogni lacrima ogni cicatrice rimasta aperta</span></p>
      <p begin="03:27.290" end="03:30.060" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="03:27.290" end="03:27.620">Thi</span><span begin="03:27.620" end="03:27.750">s</span> <span begin="03:27.750" end="03:28.070">i</span><span begin="03:28.070" end="03:28.150">s</span> <span begin="03:28.350" end="03:28.480">the</span> <span begin="03:28.480" end="03:28.980">ta</span><span begin="03:28.980" end="03:29.180">ming</span> <span begin="03:29.180" end="03:29.380">of</span> <span begin="03:29.380" end="03:29.460">the</span> <span begin="03:29.590" end="03:29.960">bea</span><span begin="03:29.960" end="03:30.060">st</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是驯服野兽之时</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是馴服野獸之時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">今こそ獣を屈服させる時</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이것이 짐승을 길들이는 방식이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">C’est ainsi qu’on dompte la bête</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así se doma a la bestia</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Das ist die Zähmung der Bestie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">É assim que se doma a fera</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Это укрощение зверя</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è domare la bestia</span></p>
      <p begin="03:30.400" end="03:34.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="03:30.400" end="03:30.820">I'll</span> <span begin="03:30.820" end="03:31.260">end</span> <span begin="03:31.260" end="03:31.430">thi</span><span begin="03:31.430" end="03:31.640">s</span> <span begin="03:31.640" end="03:32.090">war</span> <span begin="03:32.090" end="03:32.290">you</span> <span begin="03:32.290" end="03:32.490">s</span><span begin="03:32.490" end="03:32.890">tar</span><span begin="03:32.890" end="03:33.320">ted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会终结由你挑起的战争</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會終結由你挑起的戰爭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前が始めたこの戦争を私が終わらせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 시작한 이 전쟁을 내가 끝내겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je mettrai fin à cette guerre que tu as déclenchée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pondré fin a esta guerra que tú empezaste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diesen Krieg beenden den du begonnen hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou pôr fim à guerra que você começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я положу конец войне которую ты начал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Metterò fine alla guerra che hai iniziato</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:32.930" end="03:34.690"><span begin="03:32.930" end="03:33.150">(You</span> <span begin="03:33.150" end="03:33.360">s</span><span begin="03:33.360" end="03:33.720">tar</span><span begin="03:33.720" end="03:34.690">ted)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由你挑起的战争</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">由你挑起的戰爭</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前が始めた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">네가 시작한</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Que tu as déclenchée</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Que tú empezaste</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Den du begonnen hast</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Que você começou</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Которую ты начал</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Che hai iniziato</span></span></p>
      <p begin="03:33.700" end="03:38.310" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="03:33.700" end="03:33.960">I'll</span> <span begin="03:33.960" end="03:34.130">s</span><span begin="03:34.130" end="03:34.400">ti</span><span begin="03:34.400" end="03:34.560">tch</span> <span begin="03:34.560" end="03:34.730">thi</span><span begin="03:34.730" end="03:34.940">s</span> <span begin="03:34.940" end="03:35.330">woun</span><span begin="03:35.330" end="03:35.380">d</span> <span begin="03:35.380" end="03:35.610">wi</span><span begin="03:35.610" end="03:35.710">th</span> <span begin="03:35.710" end="03:36.040">blood</span><span begin="03:36.150" end="03:36.750">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会以鲜血将这道伤口缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我會以鮮血將這道傷口縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流血でこの傷を縫い合わせる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이 상처를 피로 꿰매겠어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je recoudrai cette blessure avec le sang versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Suturaré esta herida con sangre derramada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich werde diese Wunde mit Blutvergießen vernähen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vou suturar esta ferida com sangue derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я зашью эту рану кровопролитием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ricucirò questa ferita con altro sangue</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:36.240" end="03:38.310"><span begin="03:36.240" end="03:36.460">(Wi</span><span begin="03:36.460" end="03:36.560">th</span> <span begin="03:36.560" end="03:36.860">blood</span><span begin="03:36.960" end="03:38.310">shed)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">以鲜血缝合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">以鮮血縫合</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流血によって</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">피로써</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Avec le sang versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Con sangre derramada</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Mit Blutvergießen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Com sangue derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Кровопролитием</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Con altro sangue</span></span></p>
      <p begin="03:37.210" end="03:45.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="03:37.210" end="03:37.690">You</span> <span begin="03:37.690" end="03:38.000">are</span> <span begin="03:38.290" end="03:38.550">my</span> <span begin="03:38.550" end="03:38.700">wi</span><span begin="03:38.800" end="03:38.990">cked</span> <span begin="03:39.100" end="03:39.320">vic</span><span begin="03:39.450" end="03:39.730">to</span><span begin="03:39.730" end="03:45.900">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你就是我染罪的胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">你就是我染罪的勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">お前こそ私の邪悪なる勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">넌 나의 사악한 승리야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Tu es ma victoire impie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tú eres mi victoria maldita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Du bist mein unheilvoller Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Você é a minha vitória profana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ты моя порочная победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Tu sei la mia vittoria maledetta</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:38.550" end="03:40.550"><span begin="03:38.550" end="03:38.700">(Wi</span><span begin="03:38.800" end="03:38.990">cked</span> <span begin="03:39.100" end="03:39.320">vic</span><span begin="03:39.450" end="03:39.730">to</span><span begin="03:39.730" end="03:40.550">ry)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">染罪的胜利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">染罪的勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">邪悪なる勝利</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">사악한 승리</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Victoire impie</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Victoria maldita</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Unheilvoller Sieg</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Vitória profana</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Порочная победа</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vittoria maledetta</span></span></p>
    </div>
